Description: pipeline: simple: add contrast-detect autofocus
 AfMode (manual, auto, continuous), AfTrigger and AfState for sensors with
 a focus lens: a coarse scan of the lens range in ten steps, then a fine
 scan around the best coarse position, driven by the FocusFoM of the
 software ISP statistics. Continuous mode rescans when the FoM drops below
 65% of the locked value for three measurements.
 .
 Patch 3/4 of the libcamera autofocus series of iceland-mainline
 990a0597, a cherry-pick of commit
 1b79c8179ad9d1842c4fbb38ec8ba1e87d7d35e7. Regenerated against
 0.7.0-1ubuntu2 so that it applies without fuzz; the added code is
 unchanged.
